[h1]Nanite Expansion Continued — Vibe Coded 4.5 Update[/h1]

[h2]What is this?[/h2]
A standalone update of [b]Nanite Expansion Continued[/b], bringing the mod up to [i]Stellaris 4.5[/i] (tested on 4.5.2 "Cygnus"). It contains the complete mod content plus a round of compatibility and bug fixes. You do [b]not[/b] need the 4.3 workshop version installed — and you should [b]not[/b] run both at once, as this is a full replacement.

This is an [b]unofficial compatibility update[/b]. All of the mod's content — the technologies, megastructures, events, graphics and writing — is the work of the original authors credited below.

[hr]
[h2]Features (carried over from Nanite Expansion Continued)[/h2]
[list]
[*]40+ nanotechnology technologies exploring scales from the micro to the atto and everything between, inspired by the Orion's Arm sci-fi encyclopedia
[*]Nanotech ascension paths for Organic, Synth and Machine empires
[*]Two megastructures: the [b]Orbital Hyperfog[/b] and the [b]Great Archailect[/b] — a giant AI entity whose "personality" you get to influence through its event chain
[*]A Colossus planet killer that transmutes worlds into nanite worlds, unique ship components, and the Grey Tempest-style strike craft
[*]New buildings and jobs, three new armies, a subsumption bombardment stance, upgradable planet modifiers, and traits for Synths and Machines equivalent to the Brain Slug for Organics
[/list]

The full mod documentation can be found [url=//docs.google.com/document/d/e/2PACX-1vT3nr03aAEjxLBPIIKEdtvgF1tSk9VwqCy2SZcBPrWedbQy6oQ1nlwCKKy546lKKaqQOmaOP5p_IZlH/pub]here.[/url]

[hr]
[h2]What's fixed in this 4.5 update[/h2]
[list]
[*]Subsumption Bombardment works again (the game event hook it relied on was renamed in 4.5)
[*]Tier 6 nanotech research gate fixed — Galactic Wonders once again unlocks the atto-scale tech chain (the perk check was updated for the perk merge in current Stellaris)
[*]Nano Colossus fully integrated with the 4.5 planet-killer rework (awareness, Contingency machine worlds, Cosmogenesis worlds, arkships, and more)
[*]The Great Archailect personality event now correctly applies its empire modifiers and research options (it previously failed silently)
[*]Bombardment particle effects restored for all bombardment stances added since 4.3 (pox, seed bombing, voidworm invasion, firestorm, seismic bombing, ...)
[*]Technological Ascendancy no longer suppresses nanotech research weights
[*]Economic bonuses from the Archailect modifiers and the nanotech ascension perk work again
[*]Various other 4.5 script fixes: sector-rework fallout, economic categories, trait icon parameters, planet-killer component gating, and more
[/list]

[hr]
[h2]Installation[/h2]
Copy the mod folder into your Stellaris mods directory (Documents/Paradox Interactive/Stellaris/mods/) and enable it in the launcher. Use this [b]instead of[/b] the 4.3 version of Nanite Expansion Continued — do not enable both.

[hr]
[h2]Compatibility[/h2]
[list]
[*]Gigastructural Engineering: supported — this mod should load [i]after[/i] Gigastructural Engineering
[*]The Merger of Rules: supported
[*]Overwrites the vanilla orbital bombardment effects entity; minor graphical conflicts are possible with other mods that replace it
[/list]

