[hr]
[h2]AI usage disclosure[/h2]
The 4.5 compatibility work behind this update — the audit of the mod's scripts against the 4.5.2 game files, the code fixes listed above, and this workshop page text — was produced with the assistance of an AI coding agent (OpenWork). The underlying mod content remains the work of the original authors credited above. Reports of problems with the 4.5 fixes are welcome; investigations of those reports may also use AI assistance.
